Taking a taxi abroad? Ask the price before you get in 🚕

Today's phrases:
• ¿cuánto cuesta ir a…? = how much to get to…?
• al aeropuerto = to the airport
• aquí está bien = here is fine (stop here)

Save this for your trip 🔖
